{"segments": [{"start": 0.0, "end": 3.52, "text": "In this town, everyone is watching these In This Town videos."}, {"start": 4.02, "end": 7.34, "text": "And when I say everyone, I mean EVERYONE."}, {"start": 7.72, "end": 12.56, "text": "People watch them while eating breakfast, while walking their dogs, even while sitting on the toilet!"}, {"start": 13.18, "end": 16.24, "text": "Yesterday, I caught our teacher watching a video during class!"}, {"start": 16.72, "end": 21.78, "text": "On his phone, a Roblox character was running away from a giant monster, and the video said,"}, {"start": 22.18, "end": 25.5, "text": "In this town, the floor turns into lava every hour!"}, {"start": 25.5, "end": 30.54, "text": "He was so distracted that he accidentally wrote lava instead of math on the board!"}, {"start": 31.02, "end": 35.26, "text": "And my grandma? She was watching a video about a city where everyone has a mammoth!"}, {"start": 35.8, "end": 38.8, "text": "In this town, everyone has a mammoth except me!"}, {"start": 39.18, "end": 43.06, "text": "She loved it so much, she tried ordering a baby mammoth online!"}, {"start": 43.74, "end": 45.86, "text": "But there's one thing everyone keeps asking."}, {"start": 46.28, "end": 47.76, "text": "How are these videos even made?"}, {"start": 48.3, "end": 50.98, "text": "Some people think you need an entire animation studio."}, {"start": 51.38, "end": 54.28, "text": "Others think you have to spend years learning 3D animation."}, {"start": 54.28, "end": 57.2, "text": "And my best friend? He tried making one himself!"}, {"start": 57.76, "end": 59.88, "text": "His character walked straight through a wall!"}, {"start": 60.26, "end": 61.78, "text": "Then, his computer crashed!"}, {"start": 62.32, "end": 63.72, "text": "That's when I realized something."}, {"start": 64.1, "end": 69.3, "text": "Everyone loves watching these videos, but so many people have no idea how to create them."}, {"start": 69.58, "end": 71.84, "text": "So, I decided to do something about it."}, {"start": 72.02, "end": 75.26, "text": "I built my very own academy, the Block Frame Academy,"}, {"start": 75.7, "end": 79.3, "text": "a place where you can learn how to create your own Roblox story videos."}, {"start": 79.64, "end": 83.92, "text": "From coming up with crazy ideas, to writing stories, designing characters,"}, {"start": 83.92, "end": 87.94, "text": "building amazing worlds, and bringing everything to life with AI."}, {"start": 88.48, "end": 92.02, "text": "Step by step, even if you've never animated anything before."}, {"start": 92.38, "end": 94.22, "text": "All you need to get started is a computer."}, {"start": 94.78, "end": 97.3, "text": "So, if you've ever watched one of these videos and thought,"}, {"start": 97.6, "end": 100.86, "text": "I want to make that, then come join the Block Frame Academy."}, {"start": 101.34, "end": 102.78, "text": "You can find the link in my profile."}, {"start": 103.18, "end": 107.56, "text": "And maybe the next Roblox story everyone in this town is watching will be yours."}], "words": [{"w": "In", "s": 0.0, "e": 0.2}, {"w": "this", "s": 0.2, "e": 0.4}, {"w": "town,", "s": 0.4, "e": 0.72}, {"w": "everyone", "s": 1.36, "e": 1.38}, {"w": "is", "s": 1.38, "e": 1.72}, {"w": "watching", "s": 1.72, "e": 2.02}, {"w": "these", "s": 2.02, "e": 2.36}, {"w": "In", "s": 2.36, "e": 2.6}, {"w": "This", "s": 2.6, "e": 2.84}, {"w": "Town", "s": 2.84, "e": 3.16}, {"w": "videos.", "s": 3.16, "e": 3.52}, {"w": "And", "s": 4.02, "e": 4.24}, {"w": "when", "s": 4.24, "e": 4.36}, {"w": "I", "s": 4.36, "e": 4.52}, {"w": "say", "s": 4.52, "e": 4.7}, {"w": "everyone,", "s": 4.7, "e": 5.28}, {"w": "I", "s": 5.8, "e": 6.06}, {"w": "mean", "s": 6.06, "e": 6.38}, {"w": "EVERYONE.", "s": 6.38, "e": 7.34}, {"w": "People", "s": 7.72, "e": 7.94}, {"w": "watch", "s": 7.94, "e": 8.22}, {"w": "them", "s": 8.22, "e": 8.46}, {"w": "while", "s": 8.46, "e": 8.6}, {"w": "eating", "s": 8.6, "e": 8.9}, {"w": "breakfast,", "s": 8.